<title>JAPAN: Moody's rates Chubu Electric's convertible Aaa.</title>
<headline>Moody's rates Chubu Electric's convertible Aaa.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Moody's Investors Service Inc said on Wednesday it had assigned its Aaa rating to Chubu Electric Power Co Ltd's 150 billion yen worth of convertible bonds due 2006.</p>
</text>
